{'symbol': 'TER', 'date': '2021-07-27 17:02:00', 'title': 'TERADYNE REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': "NORTH READING, MASS., JULY 27, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TERADYNE, INC. (NASDAQ: TER) REPORTED REVENUE OF $1,086 MILLION FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021 OF WHICH $834 MILLION WAS IN SEMICONDUCTOR TEST, $105 MILLION IN SYSTEM TEST, $55 MILLION IN WIRELESS TEST AND $92 MILLION IN INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION (IA). GAAP NET INCOME FOR THE SECOND QUARTER WAS $328.3 MILLION OR $1.76 PER DILUTED SHARE. ON A NON-GAAP BASIS, TERADYNE'S NET INCOME IN THE SECOND QUARTER WAS $337.5 MILLION, OR $1.91 PER DILUTED SHARE, WHICH EXCLUDED ACQUIRED INTANGIBLE ASSET AMORTIZATION, RESTRUCTURING AND OTHER CHARGES, NON-CASH CONVERTIBLE DEBT INTEREST, AND INCLUDED THE RELATED TAX IMPACT ON NON-GAAP ADJUSTMENTS."}